UPDATE public.blog_posts SET content = $cm$<h2>Birmingham's Trusted Digital Marketing Agency</h2>
<p>In a city as vibrant and competitive as Birmingham, standing out online isn't optional — it's essential. Whether you're a local tradesperson, a growing e-commerce brand, or an established B2B firm, <strong>digital marketing in Birmingham</strong> is the engine that drives visibility, leads, and revenue. With <a href="https://www.statista.com/topics/1145/internet-usage-in-the-united-kingdom/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">over 95% of UK adults online</a>, your customers are already searching — the question is whether they're finding you or your competitors. That's exactly where Cornerstone Media comes in.</p>

<p>We're a Birmingham-based digital marketing agency built on transparency, results, and genuine partnerships. We don't believe in long contracts or jargon-heavy reports that gather dust. Instead, we focus on what matters: getting your business found by the right people, at the right time, through the right channels. <a href="/services">Explore our full range of services</a> to see how we can help.</p>

<h2>Expert SEO Services in Birmingham</h2>
<p><a href="/seo-birmingham"><strong>SEO in Birmingham</strong></a> is one of the most powerful long-term investments a business can make. Our approach to search engine optimisation goes far beyond stuffing keywords into a page. Aligned with <a href="https://developers.google.com/search/docs/fundamentals/seo-starter-guide" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google's official SEO guidelines</a>, we conduct thorough technical audits, build authoritative backlink profiles, and craft content strategies that position your brand as the go-to authority in your industry.</p>

<p>Our <strong>SEO Birmingham</strong> services include:</p>
<ul>
<li><a href="/technical-seo-birmingham"><strong>Technical SEO audits</strong></a> — identifying and fixing the issues that hold your site back from ranking</li>
<li><a href="/local-seo-birmingham"><strong>Local SEO</strong></a> — dominating Google Maps and local search results across Birmingham, Solihull, Wolverhampton, Walsall, and the wider West Midlands</li>
<li><a href="/content-writing"><strong>Content strategy</strong></a> — creating valuable, keyword-rich content that attracts organic traffic month after month</li>
<li><strong>On-page optimisation</strong> — ensuring every title tag, meta description, header, and internal link is working towards your ranking goals</li>
</ul>

<p>Not sure where to start? Our <a href="/seo-audit-birmingham">free SEO audit</a> will pinpoint exactly what's holding your site back.</p>

<h2>PPC Advertising That Delivers Immediate Results</h2>
<p>While SEO builds momentum over time, <a href="/ppc-birmingham"><strong>PPC in Birmingham</strong></a> delivers instant visibility. As a <a href="https://ads.google.com/home/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google Ads</a> specialist agency, we craft campaigns that put your business at the top of search results from day one. Our pay-per-click management services target the exact customers who are searching for your products or services right now.</p>

<p>Our <strong>PPC Birmingham</strong> expertise covers:</p>
<ul>
