<p>Your website is often the first impression a potential customer has of your business. A slow, outdated, or poorly designed site doesn't just look unprofessional — it actively costs you leads and sales. Our <a href="/website-design-birmingham"><strong>website design Birmingham</strong></a> services ensure your online presence is fast, modern, mobile-friendly, and built to convert — meeting <a href="https://web.dev/articles/vitals" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google's Core Web Vitals</a> standards that directly impact search rankings.</p>

